# Secrets / local creds
#
# Anchored with a leading slash where the pattern names something at the root.
# `secrets/` unanchored matched internal/cli/commands/secrets/ as well, so four
# source files in it were silently never added — `git add -A` skips an ignored
# path without a word, and the package went on compiling from the ones that had
# been moved in with `git mv`.
.env
.env.*
# The direnv file holds the live credentials; .envrc.example is the template and
# is not matched by either pattern.
/.envrc
*.pem
*.key
/secrets/

# Google OAuth client for the Gmail API, and the user credential it mints.
# The client file is only needed for the one-time consent; the credential it
# produces is a long-lived key to the mailbox.
client_secret*.json
*.apps.googleusercontent.com.json
gmail-credentials.json

# Session data / browser profile. All written at the root by the debug commands.
/cookies.json
/localStorage.json
/chrome-data/
/.chromedp-cache/

# Page dumps written by the dev commands on failure. These are snapshots of
# authenticated pages and contain personal data — never commit them.
/.debug/

# Build artifacts
/bin/
/dist/
*.test
coverage.out

# Go
/vendor/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Claude Code のローカル状態。skills/ は手順書なので追跡する。
#
# ディレクトリごと除外していた時期があり、書いたばかりの SKILL.md 3 本を
# 黙って落とした。commit も push も成功し、それを参照する CLAUDE.md まで
# 入ったので、中身が無いことに気づく手掛かりが無かった。
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
